⏺ Found it. Capacitor's lookup is <ios.path>/<ios.scheme>/<scheme>.xcodeproj —
  defaults to ios/App/App.xcodeproj. After the rename it should be
  ios/Hexmind/Hexmind.xcodeproj, which means setting ios.scheme = 'Hexmind'
  while keeping ios.path = 'ios' (default).

