⏺ Everything reverted, working tree clean. The Xcode rename adventure left zero
  footprint in git. The cosmetic "Hexmind" label is preserved through the
  Hexmind.xcscheme we committed earlier today — it shows up in Xcode's scheme
  picker without any structural rename.

