  - npx cap sync ios ✓ clean
  - git status ✓ clean
  - capacitor.config.ts ✓ reverted (no ios.scheme override needed)

  Lesson worth saving for next time: Capacitor 8 hardcodes nativeProjectDir = 
  'App' in node_modules/@capacitor/cli/dist/config.js:228. The cosmetic project
  rename in Xcode's UI must NEVER touch the parent folder name (ios/App/), the
  project filename (App.xcodeproj), or the inner source folder (App/). Use the
  scheme for the cosmetic label — that's what Xcode's chrome reads.

