          +6 colors                                                      
       97 + * with no text color that passes AA across the palette. Geome
          +try +                                                         
       98 + * iconography + text label survives all three color-blindness
       99 + * simulators (deuteranopia, protanopia, tritanopia).         
      100 + */                                                           
