⏺ Pause — fact-checking the Info.plist claims before applying. Both seem wrong:

  1. LSRequiresIPhoneOS=true is the STANDARD value for iOS apps.
  Designed-for-iPad-on-Mac works fine with this — that path runs the iOS binary
  as-is. Removing it would only matter for Catalyst (which Capacitor 8 doesn't
  support per CLAUDE.md). Skipping.
  2. NSUserActivityTypes is for SiriKit / Spotlight / custom Handoff activities.
   Universal Links work via the Associated Domains entitlement + AASA file
  alone, both of which Hexmind has. Skipping.

  The other 4 CRITICAL items are real. Executing them.

