⏺ /hitit complete — 5 critical fixes shipped + 3 reports archived

  Code that landed (0667e48)

  Fix: Modal a11y
  What: role="dialog" + aria-modal + aria-labelledby + focus restoration in
    ContextPromptModal — VoiceOver users could swipe past the dim into the
  canvas
  ────────────────────────────────────────
  Fix: Toolbar menu ARIA
  What: Downgraded role="menu"/role="menuitem" → plain buttons (broken contract
    since no kbd handling). Added Escape handler
  ────────────────────────────────────────
  Fix: Tile text contrast
  What: text-card-foreground → text-foreground — the 20%-tinted bg from 93ce8ea
    was risking WCAG 1.4.3
  ────────────────────────────────────────
  Fix: Minimap touch target
  What: X button was ~20pt; now 44×44pt hit surface per HIG
  ────────────────────────────────────────
  Fix: Mobile toolbar buttons
  What: Undo/Redo/More were p-1.5 ≈ 28pt; bumped to p-2.5

  Two iOS reviewer claims rejected on fact-check: LSRequiresIPhoneOS=true is the
   standard iOS value (compatible with Designed-for-iPad-on-Mac) and
  NSUserActivityTypes is for SiriKit/Spotlight, not Universal Links. Both
  documented in ios-review-gaps.md as agent-was-wrong.

  Three reports written to ~/.swarm/reports/2026-05-10/

  - ios-review-gaps.md — review findings + status of each (5 fixed, 7 deferred)
  - cloud-premium-business-analysis.md — full unit economics with May 2026
  prices
  - enhance-prior-art.md — Foundation-Models samples, JSON Canvas, iOS 18 icon
  variants

  Cloud-premium verdict (the one you asked for)

  Don't ship cloud-premium yet. Ship the $19.99 IAP first (per /extract); add 
  cloud as second SKU 60-90 days later only if observed demand from 
  Apple-Intelligence-ineligible devices warrants it.

  Key numbers:
  - Apple Intelligence eligibility is 35-40% of iPhones (higher than the brief's
   10-15% — iPhone 16/17 base models support it now). 60-65% locked out of free
  tier = ~900M devices = TAM justification for cloud.
  - $5.99/mo with Claude Haiku 4.5 cached = 79-93% margin at expected loads
  (10-300 calls/mo). Breakeven on a $24/mo droplet: 5 paying subs.
  - Recommended provider: Claude Haiku 4.5 (3-5× more than Gemini Flash but the
  privacy framing is the killer — Anthropic ZDR + 7-day deletion + no training).
  - Privacy framing: "two products, one app" — Free = "Hexmind" (on-device),
  Premium = "Hexmind Cloud" with explicit onboarding screen explaining the data
  path. Friction = informed consent = no deceptive-bait App Store rejection.
  - Best upgrade prompt moment: at first failed generation (contextual), not at
  app launch (coercive).

  Top 3 /enhance actions if you want cheap wins

  1. JSON Canvas import/export — 1-day work, unlocks Obsidian Canvas users
  (largest spatial-canvas community)
  2. iOS 18+ icon variants (light/dark/tinted) — half-day via your existing
  assets/build_icons.py script
  3. Reference rudrankriyam/Foundation-Models-Framework-Example 
  (https://github.com/rudrankriyam/Foundation-Models-Framework-Example) before
  writing Part A.1 — has clean @Generable schema patterns including recursive
  types that fit BranchSet { children: [Branch] } perfectly

