⏺ Elegance pass complete — 3fc8c15

  Net diff: -138 / +166 (net +28, but most of the +166 is the new
  branchPrompt.ts shared module which removes ~80 lines of duplicated prompt
  text from the two call sites).

  What landed (all 5 + tied tier)

  Correctness fix:
  - HexCanvas memo comparator now tracks answeredAskNodes — answering a
  clarifying tile will repaint reliably

  Naming:
  - contextPromptNode → clarifyingNode, contextPromptQuestion →
  clarifyingPromptText
  - Inner HexNode React.memo → HexTile (was shadowing the imported type)
  - HexCanvas aria-label "answered" suffix dropped (was misleading for
  never-asked tiles)

  Cruft:
  - showMinimap state deleted (setter was never called after toolbar toggle
  removal)
  - onIndicatorTap + isPromptOpen no-op props dropped from OnboardingTour
  - Three alias names dropped from useOnboardingTour return value
  - Four [AI] cloud … info logs gated behind import.meta.env.DEV
  - HexCanvas filterType !== 'all' dead branch removed

  Architectural (biggest win):
  - New client/src/lib/branchPrompt.ts exports BRANCH_TYPE_DISTRIBUTION_RULE,
  CLARIFICATION_RULES, JSON_OUTPUT_EXAMPLE. Both call sites import the same
  blocks now. Context-specific framing (key-themes vs board-awareness) stays
  per-call-site. Eliminates the drifting-examples problem permanently.

  Deliberately deferred (called out in the commit body)

  - Toolbar mobile More menu vs desktop folder dropdown duplication. Wrapper
  layouts differ; would need a DropdownItem abstraction rather than a flat
  extract. Worth doing in its own commit when the next dropdown lands.
  - contextHistory key-collision risk across the three modal flows
  (clarification, new-cluster, context-info). Low risk today — different key
  formats — but eventually clarifyingAnswered: boolean should live on the
  HexNode itself. Flagged for when session save/load needs to preserve answered
  state.

  Verification: 98/98 tests pass, tsc clean, build clean, cap sync clean.

