⏺ Saved to ~/.swarm/reports/2026-05-10/app-store-package-v2.md. Here's the
  headline content:

  Description (~895 chars, humanized)

  ▎ Hexmind turns brainstorming into a gesture instead of a blank document.
  ▎
  ▎ Tap an empty hex tile. Six related ideas appear in the surrounding hexes, 
  ▎ each one a different color and shape so the canvas reads at a glance. Drag 
  ▎ two tiles together and they merge into a synthesized third. Some tiles 
  ▎ realize they need your input first and ask a quick question with a few 
  ▎ suggested answers you can tap or rewrite.
  ▎
  ▎ Keep tapping, keep merging, and a half formed thought becomes a grid you can
  ▎  navigate.
  ▎
